OL,3,AChina's families are now supporting
OL,4,Amore old people than kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies in China are for the first
OL,7,Ftime supporting more elderly people
OL,8,Fthan children, the country's government
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FOfficial data released in the last week
OL,12,Fshow the ratio of China's dependent
OL,13,Felderly people compared to the working
OL,14,Fage population rose to 23% last year,
OL,15,Fovertaking the figure for children,
OL,16,Fwhich stood at 22%.
OL,18,FThe numbers are closely watched for
OL,19,Fsigns of how China's shrinking
OL,20,Fworkforce will impact both the world's
OL,21,Fsecond largest economy and global
OL,22,Fgrowth as a whole.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
