OL,3,AChina's families are now supporting
OL,4,Amore old people than kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest figures mark a significant
OL,7,Fmilestone as China grapples with an
OL,8,Fageing population that could have
OL,9,Fimplications for families, pensions and
OL,10,Fhealthcare spending, analysts say.
